 "kind": "definition",
 "title": "Monodromy data",
 "statement": "The tuple consisting of $\\rho$, the geometric group\n$H_{\\mathrm{geom}}$, the locally finite-type extension\n$G_{\\mathrm{arith}}(\\rho)$, and the degree components $G^{[m]}$ is\ncalled the *monodromy data* of the lisse Weil sheaf. The term\n``arithmetic monodromy group'' below always means this degree-graded\nextension, with grading as in [lem-wf-degree-components-grading]; its\nimage in $\\operatorname{GL}(V)$ has the Zariski closures\ndescribed in [lem-wf-degree-component-image].",
 "source": {
